      "topic": "fraction-addition",
      "obviousMisconception": "multiplies the fractions instead of adding them (e.g. 1/2 + 1/3 = 1/6)",
      "trueMisconception": "inverts the second fraction before combining, as if every operation were division (e.g. 1/2 + 1/3 = 1/2 x 3/1 = 3/2)",
